  "description": "Welcome to the whimsical world of “Small Bubble”, a contemporary Bubble font where every character boasts its own charm and uniqueness. With its lovable and stylish appeal, Small Bubble effortlessly stands as an ideal choice for sublimation designs. Think enchanting t-shirt prints, warm and inviting mugs, fashionable tote bags, lively animations, or engaging comic titles. Let your creativity frolic in Small Bubble’s captivating demeanor.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Welcome to the whimsical world of “Small Bubble”, a contemporary Bubble font where every character boasts its own charm and uniqueness. With its lovable and stylish appeal, Small Bubble effortlessly stands as an ideal choice for sublimation designs. Think enchanting t-shirt prints, warm and inviting mugs, fashionable tote bags, lively animations, or engaging comic titles. Let your creativity frolic in Small Bubble’s captivating demeanor.</p>",
